  "bytes": 7292,
  "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>Arquivo Zero — Caçada Digital</title>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Pixelify+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@24,500,0,0&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css?v=mobile-import-001\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <canvas id=\"scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></canvas>\n  <div class=\"desktop-shell\">\n    <header class=\"topbar\">\n      <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#\"><span>Arquivo Zero</span></a>\n      <nav class=\"game-menu\" aria-label=\"Menu do jogo\"><span>Jogo</span><span>Opções</span><span>Casos</span></nav>\n      <div class=\"top-actions\">\n        <button class=\"menu-action\" id=\"reset-button\" title=\"Apaga só este capítulo. Campanha e estrelas permanecem.\">Reiniciar capítulo</button>\n        <button class=\"menu-action\" id=\"reset-campaign-button\" title=\"Sorteia nova campanha. Estrelas permanecem.\">Reiniciar campanha</button>\n        <button class=\"menu-action\" id=\"reset-career-button\" title=\"Apaga as estrelas. Capítulo e campanha permanecem.\">Zerar carreira</button>\n        <label class=\"menu-action file-label\">Importar<input id=\"json-input\" type=\"file\" accept=\".json,application/json\"></label>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n    <main class=\"game-console\">\n      <section class=\"screen-grid\">\n        <div class=\"city-column\">\n          <header class=\"location-header retro-window\">\n            <h2 id=\"location-title\">São Paulo</h2>\n            <div class=\"time-line\"><span id=\"time-left\">72h</span> restantes</div>\n            <div class=\"time-track\" aria-label=\"Prazo operacional\"><span id=\"time-bar\"></span></div>\n          </header>\n          <figure class=\"city-frame retro-window\">\n            <img id=\"city-image\" src=\"assets/cities/sao-paulo.webp\" alt=\"Vista em pixel art de São Paulo\">\n            <figcaption><span id=\"location-type\">Cena do crime</span><span id=\"coords\"></span></figcaption>\n          </figure>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"intel-column\">\n          <header class=\"mission-header retro-window\">\n            <div><span class=\"status-light\"></span><span id=\"case-code\">CASO</span></div>\n            <h1 id=\"game-title\">Carregando…</h1>\n          </header>\n          <section class=\"intel-frame retro-window\">\n            <p id=\"briefing\" class=\"briefing\"></p>\n            <div class=\"city-intel\">\n              <p id=\"location-description\" class=\"case-context\"></p>\n              <div class=\"city-briefing\" aria-labelledby=\"city-briefing-title\">\n                <span id=\"city-briefing-title\">ARQUIVO DA CIDADE</span>\n                <h3 id=\"location-name\"></h3>\n                <p id=\"city-summary\"></p>\n                <ul id=\"city-facts\"></ul>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"places-title\"><span>LOCAIS PARA INVESTIGAR</span><small>Escolha uma ação</small></div>\n            <div id=\"location-actions\" class=\"location-actions\"></div>\n          </section>\n          <nav class=\"command-bar\" aria-label=\"Ações principais\">\n            <button id=\"evidence-button\" class=\"command-button\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">visibility</span><strong>PISTAS</strong></button>\n            <button id=\"map-button\" class=\"command-button\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">flight_takeoff</span><strong>VIAJAR</strong></button>\n            <button id=\"notes-button\" class=\"command-button\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">search</span><strong>ANOTAR</strong></button>\n            <button id=\"dossier-button\" class=\"command-button crime\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">folder_special</span><strong>DOSSIÊ</strong></button>\n          </nav>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n  </div>\n  <dialog id=\"map-dialog\" class=\"modal map-modal\">\n    <button class=\"modal-close\" data-close=\"map-dialog\" aria-label=\"Fechar mapa\">×</button>\n    <div class=\"map-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">REDE DE DESLOCAMENTO</p><h2>Escolha o próximo destino</h2></div><div class=\"map-legend\"><span><i class=\"node current\"></i>VOCÊ</span><span><i class=\"node available\"></i>DESTINO</span><span><i class=\"node visited\"></i>VISITADO</span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"map-layout\">\n      <div class=\"map-card\"><div class=\"map-grid\"></div><svg id=\"route-lines\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 620\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"></svg><div id=\"city-layer\"></div></div>\n      <aside class=\"route-panel\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span>ROTA DA CAÇADA</span><strong id=\"visited-count\">1 cidade</strong></div><div id=\"route-log\" class=\"route-log\"></div></aside>\n    </div>\n  </dialog>\n  <dialog id=\"evidence-dialog\" class=\"modal evidence-modal evidence-modal-v2\">\n    <button class=\"modal-close\" data-close=\"evidence-dialog\" aria-label=\"Fechar pistas\">×</button>\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">QUADRO DE EVIDÊNCIAS</p>\n    <div class=\"section-head\"><h2>Pistas catalogadas</h2><strong id=\"evidence-count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0 catalogadas</strong></div>\n    <p class=\"panel-help\">Somente provas que você localizou. Fato e interpretação ficam separados; inadmissíveis e contradições permanecem visíveis. Identificar ≠ provar.</p>\n    <div id=\"evidence-list\" class=\"evidence-list\" hidden aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    <div id=\"evidence-board-host\" class=\"evidence-board-host\"></div>\n  </dialog>\n  <dialog id=\"travel-dialog\" class=\"modal compact-modal\"><button class=\"modal-close\" data-close=\"travel-dialog\" aria-label=\"Fechar autorização de viagem\">×</button><p class=\"eyebrow\">AUTORIZAÇÃO DE VIAGEM</p><h2 id=\"travel-title\"></h2><p id=\"travel-copy\"></p><div class=\"modal-actions\"><button class=\"secondary\" data-close=\"travel-dialog\">CANCELAR</button><button id=\"confirm-travel\" class=\"primary\">CONFIRMAR ROTA</button></div></dialog>\n  <dialog id=\"dossier-dialog\" class=\"modal compact-modal\"><button class=\"modal-close\" data-close=\"dossier-dialog\" aria-label=\"Fechar dossiê\">×</button><p class=\"eyebrow\">DOSSIÊ PARA MANDADO</p><h2>Identifique o fugitivo</h2><p>Use as evidências reunidas para preencher o perfil e identificar uma única pessoa.</p><form id=\"dossier-form\" class=\"dossier-form\"></form></dialog>\n  <dialog id=\"notes-dialog\" class=\"modal compact-modal\"><button class=\"modal-close\" data-close=\"notes-dialog\" aria-label=\"Fechar caderno de campo\">×</button><p class=\"eyebrow\">CADERNO DE CAMPO</p><h2>Suas anotações</h2><textarea id=\"notebook\" placeholder=\"Registre destinos, relações e hipóteses…\"></textarea><div class=\"note-footer\"><span id=\"char-count\">0 caracteres</span><span>SALVO AUTOMATICAMENTE</span></div></dialog>\n  <dialog id=\"message-dialog\" class=\"modal compact-modal\"><button class=\"modal-close\" data-close=\"message-dialog\" aria-label=\"Fechar mensagem\">×</button><p class=\"eyebrow\" id=\"message-kicker\"></p><h2 id=\"message-title\"></h2><div id=\"message-copy\"></div><button class=\"primary wide\" data-close=\"message-dialog\">CONTINUAR</button></dialog>\n  <script type=\"module\" src=\"app.js?v=retro-ui-003\"></script>\n  <script type=\"module\" src=\"modules/ui/evidence/evidence-board.js?v=az-evidence-005\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
